    "detailed_description": "Kana Ka-Boom is for those interested in starting their journey of learning the Japanese language, and for those looking for a fun way to practice and retain their Katakana and Hiragana skills.<br><br>Fireworks of kana characters launch into the air. By typing the correct letters on your keyboard, you'll light up the sky!<br><br>Track your progress and earn medals as you complete lessons, or use free play mode to create a session all your own.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple game and interface to get you quickly into practicing your kana<br></li><li>Trivia and facts about the Japanese language<br></li><li>Spoken characters so you can hear what the kana sound like<br></li><li>Freeplay mode to customize your own play session including firework count, speed, sudden death option, and timer options</li></ul>",
